su text "sense-gloss:n:92462513-n" ob text "Either of two letters in Cyrillic alphabets, which originally represented phonemically the ultra-short vowels in Slavic languages.; For determining whether a yer is strong or weak, it is necessary to break the continuous flow of speech into individual words, or prosodic units (phrases which have only a single stressed syllable, and typically include a preposition or other clitic words)." ya
su text "sense-lemma:n:92462513-n:1" ob text "yer" ya
