su text "sense-gloss:r:00009459-r" ob text "completely and without qualification; used informally as intensifiers; an absolutely magnificent painting; a perfectly idiotic idea; you're perfectly right; utterly miserable; you can be dead sure of my innocence; was dead tired; dead right" ya
