su text "sense-lemma:r:00025968-r:2" ob text "somewhere" ya
su text "r:00026137-r" ob name "everywhere" as text "r" with text "deterministic" via text "leaf/edge WordNet node r:00026137-r has one meaning for lemma everywhere and existing Pyash coverage; active through sweep wordnet-sense-sweep-4c07194f363e-81b5bbefa3b0-d1 (source 4c07194f363e9c870dc925b8cab26f9af93899f6bd91a29b9a1422c1f66d95ba)" ya
su text "sense-gloss:r:00026137-r" ob text "to or in any or all places; pronoun, location; quantifier: universal; You find fast food stores everywhere; people everywhere are becoming aware of the problem; he carried a gun everywhere he went; looked all over for a suitable gift" ya
